## Summary

I shipped a production-quality native Apple parity of the web `LegacyAlertsRedirect` surface (P4 · 0185), committed as `9af1eb8cb`.

**Delivered** (`apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/LegacyAlertsRedirect.*`):
- **`.Model.swift`** — pure resolver reproducing every web branch: `TAB_TO_ROUTE` map (alerts→/notifications/alerts, history→/notifications/inbox, preferences→/notifications/quiet-hours), absent‑tab default, unknown/empty‑tab fallback, and a **byte‑exact `URLSearchParams`** query model (ordered pairs, first‑value `get`, delete‑all, x‑www‑form‑urlencoded with `+`). Binds the real `AppRoute`.
- **`.Telemetry.swift`** — P1/S11 `view.opened` + redaction‑safe redirect event (os_log sink).
- **`.swift`** — SwiftUI interstitial (spinner + localized title + destination chip + subtitle) that dispatches the decision to the host nav seam once on appear (parity of `<Navigate replace>`); VoiceOver label/value, Dynamic Type, never blank.
- **`.Previews.swift`** (6 branches), **`.Tests.swift`** (27 cases), **`.strings`** (P1/S10 i18n table).

